    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\dfrac{\\sqrt[3]3}{3}$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac1{\\sqrt[3]9}&=\\frac{\\sqrt[3]3}{\\sqrt[3]9\\times\\sqrt[3]3}\\\\\\frac1{\\sqrt[3]9}&=\\frac{\\sqrt[3]3}{\\sqrt[3]{27}}\\\\\\frac1{\\sqrt[3]9}&=\\frac{\\sqrt[3]3}{3}\\end{align*}$$",
